<title>UK: UK Enterprise Inns sells pubs to Ann Street.</title>
<headline>UK Enterprise Inns sells pubs to Ann Street.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>British pub operator Enterprise Inns Plc said on Wednesday it had sold 11 pubs and seven undeveloped sites for 6.82 million stg in cash to Ann Street Brewery Company Ltd.</p>
<p>The pubs and sites being sold are part of the Discovery Inns estate which Enterprise Inns bought in May 1997.</p>
<p>The remaining 35 pubs that were part of Discovery Inns have already been converted to tenancies or leases.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4366</p>
